---
fmContentType: glossaryEntry
term: "Golden Dragon"
letter: "G"
anchor: "golden-dragon"
category: "edibles"
---

A cannabis tincture made using a quick cold-wash method — both the cannabis and alcohol are frozen before a brief extraction, minimising the chlorophyll and plant waxes pulled into the tincture. The result is a cleaner, lighter-coloured (golden), more neutral-tasting tincture compared to Green Dragon. Preferred for sublingual use and applications where clean flavour matters, such as cannabis sugar or beverages.

→ [How to Make Cannabis Tincture](/edibles/how-to-make-cannabis-tincture-green-golden-dragon/)
